# ==============================================
# AI/TOOL SCAFFOLD — must never exist in the module tree.
# Auto-generated forbidden paths — do not edit manually
# Generated by AI agents / external CI, never part of the module domain.
# Grouped, deduped. See docs/wiki/rules/module-theme-root-cleanup.md
# LARAXOT MODULE: TENANT — .gitignore
# Laraxot — IDE folders forbidden at module/theme root (see module-theme-root-hygiene)
# Laraxot — quality tool configs forbidden in module/theme root (use laravel/phpinsights.php, laravel/rector.php)
# MODULE ROOT FORBIDDEN DIRS
# Patterns cover both module root and nested occurrences (docs/**).
# Reason: root cleanup policy (see docs/wiki/rules/root-cleanup-policy.md)
# See docs/wiki/rules/module-theme-root-cleanup.md
